1
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:16,440
Scoundrel!

2
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,880
You were just in danger.

3
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,440
I thought you seemed strange this morning.

4
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,240
So, you really are an omega-type person.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,800
Omega what now?

6
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,760
I'm warning you!

7
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:25,720
If you dare follow me again,

8
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,080
I’ll beat you up every time I see you.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,680
Crazy!

10
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:29,840
Pervert!

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,120
When bad luck strikes, you meet all kinds of weirdos.

12
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,080
That bastard Hao Ruichi

13
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:52,560
caused my crystals to shatter completely.

14
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,400
But it’s okay.

15
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,800
I’m finally

16
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,440
free!

17
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,160
The spaceship is destroyed.

18
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,440
The crystal energy is depleted.

19
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,280
Before I find Aiyet,

20
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,880
I need to find a place to stay.

21
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:54,960
Bro,

22
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:55,640
finding a place to live,

23
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,080
easy peasy.

24
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,680
My one and only best friend and confidant,

25
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,640
comes from a wealthy family,

26
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,400
runs a restaurant as a personal hobby,

27
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,840
is a hardcore foodie,

28
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:14,360
and also a notorious culinary killer.

29
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,920
Try my new dish!

30
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:16,640
Hurry!

31
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,640
It’s simple!

32
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,040
Are you sure this thing can make money?

33
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,040
Stop nagging!

34
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,720
Just try it!

35
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,280
Why are you staring at me?

36
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,080
Come on, eat it!

37
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:37,120
Am I going to die?

38
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,200
Well?

39
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,040
Does it taste good?

40
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,160
It's... It's not bad.

41
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,480
Qi Miao,

42
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,920
you really understand me best.

43
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,160
Wait, that’s odd.

44
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,440
You’re acting strange today.

45
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,760
Okay, tell me,

46
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,320
what do you need me to help you with?

47
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:59,360
Actually, the reason I came to see you today

48
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,920
was to ask if I could borrow...

49
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,320
Hello?

50
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:07,920
Hello, sis?

51
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,240
Did you sort out the rent issue?

52
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:10,640
Did you get the money back?

53
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,160
Don’t worry, it went well.

54
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:12,720
I’ll tell you all about it when I get back.

55
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:13,960
Alright.

56
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,560
I’ll head home right now.

57
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,480
You just wait for me.

58
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,600
Simple as that.

59
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,480
I still have something to handle.

60
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,360
I'll take my leave now.

61
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,800
Next time, I'll help you taste test your dishes. Next time!

62
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,000
Hello?

63
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,200
As expected, you can't rely on besties.

64
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,480
When will my muse for inspiration

65
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,560
finally show up?

66
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:41,880
Sis, you're back!

67
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,840
How’s everything?

68
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,240
Did you get the rent back?

69
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,560
Surprise!

70
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,080
You creep!

71
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,600
Explain yourself!

72
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,480
What’s going on here?

73
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,360
Sis, aren’t you worried about the rent?

74
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,760
Since I have a packed schedule this semester,

75
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,480
I won't be coming back often,

76
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,680
so I figured I’d just rent out my room.

77
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,400
Plus,

78
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,600
it can help with household expenses.

79
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,080
Help with expenses? Yeah, right!

80
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,720
Can’t you at least discuss things with me

81
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,160
before deciding on something?

82
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,360
I told you before, you lack any business sense!

83
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:20,640
If the room’s just sitting empty,

84
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,400
why not rent it out?

85
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,119
I don’t agree with this!

86
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,160
Besides,

87
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,879
he’s a total creep!

88
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:28,480
A creep?

89
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,360
Sis,

90
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,240
do you know him?

91
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,920
Today, he

92
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,120
kept following me around!

93
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,520
Bro.

94
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,720
What's going on?

95
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,240
First of all,

96
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,520
I am not stalking you,

97
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,800
nor am I the pervert you claim.

98
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:50,640
Secondly,

99
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,200
I am an Envoy from the Blue Star.

100
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,520
My name is Hao Ruichi.

101
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,760
I now need a place to stay.

102
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,720
Thirdly,

103
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:59,360
once my mission is complete,

104
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,600
I will naturally leave.

105
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,720
Look at him!

106
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,240
Not only is he a perv,

107
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,600
but he's also not too bright!

108
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,400
Sis,

109
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,560
this guy's clearly not right in the head,

110
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,080
but he's dumb and loaded with cash.

111
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,440
I offered to charge him twice the market rate for rent,

112
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,880
and he agreed without hesitation!

113
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,480
Besides,

114
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,000
who cares which star he's from?

115
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:18,280
As long as the rent is covered,

116
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,200
isn't that all that matters?

117
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,000
I already said it's impossible, and I mean it!

118
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,120
Look at him,

119
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,240
does he look like someone who has money?

120
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,200
Bro,

121
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:30,120
since you know my sister,

122
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,400
it must be fate.

123
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,120
Why don't you pay up now,

124
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,000
to put my sister's mind at ease?

125
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,280
I don't have the money you're talking about.

126
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,520
What did I say?

127
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,600
No money, right?

128
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,880
Hurry up and get rid of him!

129
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,840
But he's already rented the place!

130
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,400
Still, I do have some

131
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,560
currency from my star.

132
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,280
I wonder if it’s usable here.

133
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,160
Mr. Qi,

134
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:55,960
have the rent been paid?

135
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,440
I always knew you siblings

136
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,640
would have a bright future!

137
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,920
I already told you,

138
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,280
that little bit of rent doesn’t matter.

139
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:07,120
Why do you keep

140
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:07,960
nagging me about it every day?

141
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:09,400
Then it's nothing serious.

142
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,760
I won't bother you any further. You should rest.

143
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,880
That's enough to cover six months' rent!

144
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,440
Who exactly are you?

145
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,480
Where did you come from?

146
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,400
Let me say it one more time.

147
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,960
I am from

148
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,480
the Blue Ke Star of the Laniakea Supercluster.

149
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,240
I am an envoy from the planet.

150
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,480
I came here

151
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:35,680
to catch a very dangerous criminal.

152
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,160
However, since the energy crystal is damaged,

153
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:41,440
I need a temporary place to stay.

154
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:42,720
No way.

155
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,520
This person is definitely crazy.

156
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,280
Keeping him at home is way too dangerous.

157
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,040
Sis,

158
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,760
how can you say that about our honorable Star Envoy?

159
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,560
Bro,

160
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,440
no matter if you're from Cocoa Star or Pumpkin Star,

161
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,960
you'll always be my lucky star.

162
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,840
Here, have a seat.

163
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:55,840
Qi Dongdong,

164
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,520
Honorable Star Envoy,

165
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,480
you can stay in this house as you please.

166
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,760
If anything feels uncomfortable, just let me know.

167
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,280
I'll peel an apple for you, bro.

168
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,640
Can you just shut up!

169
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,520
Fine.

170
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:08,560
Since you're the one who paid the rent, I have nothing to say.

171
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:11,200
But if you want to continue living here,

172
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,640
we need to establish three rules.

173
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,720
First,

174
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,280
you are not allowed to enter my room

175
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,520
without my permission.

176
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,560
Second,

177
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:20,200
if we're in the same space,

178
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,640
you must maintain a one-meter distance from me.

179
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,040
At least give me some kind of response!

180
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,360
What if you're the one who gets close to me?

181
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,960
As if I would ever get close to you.

182
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,200
My sister has a terrible streak of luck.

183
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,000
She's just like this all the time.

184
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,880
Don't take it personally, okay?

185
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,200
Oops, that was a mistake just now.

186
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,200
I... I haven't finished talking yet!

187
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:54,920
Thirdly.

188
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:55,960
From now on,

189
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:58,040
you're responsible for all the chores.

190
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,080
The chores.

191
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:00,840
Exactly.

192
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,760
Things like cooking, doing laundry, and mopping.

193
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,040
Are you saying

194
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,600
you want me to do those menial tasks?

195
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,560
Not willing, are you?

196
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,240
If you’re unwilling, then move out.

197
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:16,880
Fine.

198
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,840
I agree to all your conditions.

199
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,080
But we need to adjust the third one.

200
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,680
First of all,

201
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,640
I'm the one who rented this place.

202
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,520
I hold the right to use this property.

203
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,920
Secondly, you’re my tenant, so I...

204
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,520
Therefore,

205
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,000
the chores

206
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,320
should be done by you.

207
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,600
Otherwise, I’ll have the landlord kick you out.

208
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,120
You...

209
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,720
What are you saying?

210
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,599
This guy’s not stupid.

211
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:42,800
And also,

212
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,440
I'm hungry now.

213
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,120
Go prepare dinner.

214
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,199
You...

215
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,560
What’s wrong?

216
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,360
If you don't want to stay,

217
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,360
then move out.

218
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,560
What kind of situation is this?

219
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,040
There’s already one unreliable person,

220
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,320
and now there’s a total lunatic?

221
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,480
This is so annoying.

222
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,440
Brother,

223
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,560
do you have any gold left?

224
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,920
If you do, we could pay next quarter's rent

225
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,680
in advance together.

226
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,200
I never expected

227
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,520
to end up suddenly in this place,

228
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,480
so I didn’t bring extra currency with me.

229
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,600
Then do you have any other valuables?

230
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,240
Yes.

231
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:32,680
Brother,

232
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,800
your crystal doesn’t look that great.

233
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,440
It’s not worth much.

234
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:40,280
Energy crystals are extremely rare.

235
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,800
Only a select few possess them.

236
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,160
Like someone as special as me, a Bluke Star Envoy.

237
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,360
Yes, yes, of course.

238
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,360
So, as a Bluke Star Envoy,

239
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,960
do you have any special abilities?

240
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,680
Show us, then!

241
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,800
We Blukes,

242
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,240
can't freely use our powers

243
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,960
outside of our own planet's environment.

244
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,920
To activate our abilities,

245
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,000
we need the energy from the crystals.

246
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,080
But my crystal is damaged,

247
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,320
and its energy has leaked out.

248
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,640
Only by replenishing the energy can I use my powers again.

249
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,320
Bro,

250
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,480
it's a shame you're not a scriptwriter.

251
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,280
You'd definitely write better stories than my sister.

252
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,760
What do you mean by that?

253
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,120
Sis,

254
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,840
it's clear broth egg soup again?

255
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,720
That's all we have at home.

256
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,400
Take it or leave it.

257
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,080
Well,

258
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,960
I'll just grab food at school instead.

259
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,920
Take your time eating.

260
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:28,880
Sis,

261
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,760
remember to get along with the great Star Envoy.

262
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,040
I've overused my energy these past days.

263
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,480
I need to recharge.

264
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:43,520
Take me to the most delicious food in your place.

265
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,720
Don't push your luck!

266
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,480
Alright, fine.

267
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,480
I'll go contact the landlord then.

268
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,040
So, this is the most delicious food in your area?

269
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,240
Where are you even from?

270
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,880
You haven't even tried snail rice noodles?

271
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:08,840
Let me tell you,

272
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,800
this dish right here,

273
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:12,440
might not be the absolute best food we have,

274
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,320
but I guarantee,

275
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,080
it'll make you outsiders fall in love with it.

276
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,360
You Earthlings are so strange.

277
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,040
Consider this meal,

278
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:27,280
my treat to you.

279
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:29,280
From now on, we're roommates.

280
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,880
Stop being so crazy,

281
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,320
and we can get along just fine.

282
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,400
From your aura,

283
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,200
I can tell that you must

284
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,960
still be a kind-hearted person.

285
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:41,600
Alright then.

286
